---
// IndustriesCrossSector.astro
// "Transforming Experience" two-column section.
// Background: DARK navy gradient
// Cards: white on dark — matches WhyJayveecons.astro exactly
---

<style>
  /* ── DARK navy gradient ── */
  .cross-sector {
    padding-block: clamp(48px, 8vh, 96px);
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 70% at 65% 40%, rgba(8,56,146,0.9) 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 5%  90%, rgba(192,24,30,.07) 0%, transparent 50%),
      linear-gradient(155deg, var(--navy-deep) 0%, var(--ink) 55%, var(--black) 100%);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cross-inner {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px);
  }

  /* Stack on mobile, side-by-side at 1024px
     align-items: start — each column manages its own vertical rhythm */
  .cross-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .cross-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }

  /* Left column: flex so we can push cards to align with copy, not headline */
  .cross-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* Spacer pushes the headline out of the vertical center calculation —
     cards will naturally sit against the paragraph block height */
  .cross-copy-header {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cross-copy-body {
    flex: 1;
  }

  /* ── Section tag — matches WhyJayveecons ── */
  .section-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-tag .line { width: 28px; height: 2px; background: var(--crimson); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .section-tag span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--crimson-l);
  }

  /* ── Headline — matches WhyJayveecons ── */
  .section-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 56px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: .97;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-headline .accent { color: var(--crimson-l); }

  /* ── Left copy — fog on dark, matches WhyJayveecons body text ── */
  .cross-copy p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.5vw, 16px);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--fog);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .cross-copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .cross-copy p strong { color: var(--white); font-weight: 500; }

  /* ── Right: card column — flex, fills height ── */
  .cross-points {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px; /* matches why-grid gap */
  }

  /* ── White card — matches WhyJayveecons .why-card exactly ── */
  .cross-point {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: clamp(18px, 2.5vw, 28px) clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px);
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
    border-top: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: border-top-color .25s, box-shadow .25s, transform .25s;
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cross-point:hover {
    border-top-color: #c0181e;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.32);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  /* Subtle corner glow — matches WhyJayveecons .why-card::after */
  .cross-point::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; right: 0;
    width: 90px; height: 90px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(8,56,146,.04), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* ── Icon box ── */
  .cp-icon {
    width: 38px; height: 38px;
    background: rgba(192,24,30,.07);
    border: 1px solid rgba(192,24,30,.18);
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: #c0181e;
    margin-top: 2px; /* optical alignment with title */
  }
  .cp-icon svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }

  /* ── Card title — matches .why-title from WhyJayveecons ── */
  .cp-title {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.6vw, 18px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    color: rgba(8,56,146,.9); /* FIX: was missing value entirely */
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  /* ── Card description — matches .why-text from WhyJayveecons ── */
  .cp-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(13px, 1.3vw, 14px);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #3a4560;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Reveal ── */
  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity .65s ease, transform .65s ease; }
  .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; } }
</style>

<section class="cross-sector" aria-labelledby="cross-heading">
  <div class="cross-inner">
    <div class="cross-grid">

      <!-- Left: copy split into header + body -->
      <div class="cross-copy reveal">
        <div class="cross-copy-header">
          <div class="section-tag"><div class="line"></div><span>Why Jayveecons</span></div>
          <h2 class="section-headline" id="cross-heading">
            Transforming Experience<br>
            <span class="accent">Into Engineered Solutions.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="cross-copy-body">
          <p>
            Jayveecons' strength is not simply that we serve multiple industries — it is that decades
            of process engineering, manufacturing, and material handling experience developed in one
            sector continuously informs the solutions we deliver in another. Since our beginnings in
            cement and Vertical Shaft Kiln systems in 1987, we have built engineering knowledge across
            bulk solids handling, thermal processing, storage, conveying, and industrial process systems
            that translates across industries and applications.
          </p>
          <p>
            While every industry has unique operational requirements, the core engineering challenges —
            material flow, abrasion, temperature, wear, contamination control, throughput, reliability,
            and maintainability — often share the same underlying principles. Our experience across
            cement, mining, food processing, waste management, fertilizers, steel, and industrial
            processing sectors allows us to approach new projects with a broader understanding of
            material behaviour, operating conditions, and long-term equipment performance.
          </p>
          <p>
            This cross-sector experience enables Jayveecons to deliver solutions that are not only
            application-specific, but strengthened by lessons learned across decades of real industrial
            operations — equipment engineered with practical manufacturing knowledge, field experience,
            and proven process understanding.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: cards aligned via CSS to the copy body, not the headline -->
      <div class="cross-points reveal" style="align-self: center; padding-top: clamp(0px, 2vh, 16px)">

        <div class="cross-point">
          <div class="cp-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="cp-title">In-House Fabrication</div>
            <p class="cp-desc">Every component machined, rolled, welded, and balanced in our own facility — no sub-contractors for critical parts.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cross-point">
          <div class="cp-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
              <path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 010 14.14M4.93 4.93a10 10 0 000 14.14"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="cp-title">Material-First Design</div>
            <p class="cp-desc">We begin every enquiry with material properties — bulk density, abrasiveness, moisture, temperature — before selecting equipment type.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cross-point">
          <div class="cp-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/>
              <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="cp-title">Complete Documentation</div>
            <p class="cp-desc">GA drawings, material certificates, weld maps, hydrostatic test records — supplied as standard, not as an extra.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cross-point">
          <div class="cp-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="cp-title">Engineering Support</div>
            <p class="cp-desc">Our engineers respond to technical enquiries within 24 hours and can visit site for assessment anywhere in India.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>